# Same-origin proxy for the BTC Nodes API (Netlify).
# Mirrors the local server.js proxy and explorer/vercel.json rewrite so the
# explorer's origin-root fetches to /api/btcnodes/* work in production.
# Status 200 = rewrite (proxy), not a redirect. Query strings pass through.
/api/btcnodes/*  https://btcnodes.io/api/:splat  200
